I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs filesystem access, and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` needs `http-client`. Neither is granted, and the target has no WASI. Adding either would exceed the node's authority. The input text would also be sent to an outside service. If the team wants them, the graph's `with` clause has to grant them first.

